{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47258","headline":"一字至七字诗 书 · 范尧佐","name":"一字至七字诗 书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"书，凭鴈，寄鱼。\n出王屋，入匡庐。\n文生益智，道着清虚。\n葛洪一万卷，惠子五车余。\n银钩屈曲索靖，题桥司马相如。\n别後莫暌千里信，数封缄送到闲居。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"范尧佐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47258.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47258","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}